<header class="mast"><div class="wrap"><a class="brand" href="../../index.html"><img src="../../mark.svg" width="26" height="26" alt="">生物信息学手记</a><div class="proof-label">阅读校样 <span>/ 01</span></div><a class="compare" href="$original">对照原版 ↗</a></div></header>
<div class="wrap spread">
<aside class="rail" aria-label="书籍导航"><div class="rail-inner"><div class="overline">全书目录</div><nav class="book-nav" aria-label="全书目录">$book_nav</nav><a class="home" href="../../index.html">← 返回全书</a></div></aside>
<main id="chapter"><div class="tools"><span class="folio">第 $number 章 <span>/</span> $part</span><details class="menu"><summary><span class="desktop">本章</span>目录</summary><div class="popover"><div class="overline">本章目录</div><nav class="sections" aria-label="本章目录">$toc<a href="#sources"><small>※</small>来源与核验记录</a></nav><div class="mobile"><div class="overline">全书目录</div><nav class="book-nav" aria-label="全书目录">$book_nav</nav></div></div></details></div>
<article><h1>$title</h1><p class="credit">原论文：Martínez-de-Morentin、Khan 等 <span>·</span> <cite>Nature Methods</cite> <a href="https://doi.org/10.1038/s41592-026-03272-x">DOI ↗</a></p>
<div class="lead">$lead</div>
<figure class="opening"><img src="boundaries.svg" alt="左右两幅的点位完全相同。黑色十字在左图绿色边界外，在右图绿色边界内。"><figcaption><strong>读图</strong> 两幅图里的点没有动。只把分界线向右移，十字标记的 RNA 就换了归属。<span>编者示意 · 非实验数据</span></figcaption></figure>
$article
<section class="sources" aria-labelledby="sources"><h2 id="sources"><small>※</small>来源与核验记录</h2><details><summary>展开阅读范围、限制、图版许可与原归档封面</summary>$records</details></section>
</article><footer><a href="#start">↑ 回到章首</a><a href="$original">对照原版 ↗</a></footer></main></div>
<script>const menu=document.querySelector('.menu');menu.addEventListener('click',event=>{if(event.target.closest('a'))menu.open=false});document.addEventListener('keydown',event=>{if(event.key==='Escape'&&menu.open){menu.open=false;menu.querySelector('summary').focus()}});document.addEventListener('click',event=>{if(menu.open&&!menu.contains(event.target))menu.open=false});</script>
</body></html>
